1877 0 obj
<<
/Title (We often become attached not only to people, but to versions of them. We remember how they spoke to us, how they made ordinary days feel special, and how naturally they once occupied a place in our lives.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1871 0 R
/Next 1883 0 R
>>
endobj
1878 0 obj
<<
/Title (Not every person who leaves your life was pretending. Not every rela- tionship that ends was a mistake. And not every distance needs to be filled with resentment.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1871 0 R
/Prev 1884 0 R
>>
endobj
1879 0 obj
<<
/Title (Some people teach us through their presence. Others teach us through their absence.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1871 0 R
/Next 1885 0 R
>>
endobj
1880 0 obj
<<
/Title (It is learning to remain kind without abandoning your self-respect.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1886 0 R
/Next 1872 0 R
>>
endobj
1881 0 obj
<<
/Title (We want people to understand us. We want our efforts to produce res- ults. We want the future to follow the plans we have carefully construc- ted.)
/Dest [27 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1855 0 R
/Prev 1873 0 R
/Next 1887 0 R
>>
endobj
1882 0 obj
<<
/Title (You can prepare for an opportunity and still not receive it. You can love someone and still not control their decisions. You can work honestly and still encounter unfairness.)
/Dest [27 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1855 0 R
/Prev 1887 0 R
/Next 1874 0 R
>>
endobj
1883 0 obj
<<
